[PrintTextModified Text:来到医务室，<br>玛格、梅露露和安安也在。|#0201Adv14_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到我和诺亚进来，<br>梅露露有些拘谨地走了过来。|#0201Adv14_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，啊……希、希罗小姐……！<br>之前真是非常感谢你的照顾……|#0201Adv14_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我不记得照顾过你。<br>玛格的情况怎么样？|#0201Adv14_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，是……<br>玛格小姐的伤口已经愈合，<br>气色也好多了。|#0201Adv14_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:躺在床上的玛格坐了起来。|#0201Adv14_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
