[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵，多亏了梅露露呢。<br>一直守在我身边照顾我……|#0201Adv14_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当然也要感谢希罗。<br>多亏了你们的悉心照料。<br>真的非常感谢。|#0201Adv14_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:伤势很重，不能掉以轻心。<br>尽量保持静养比较好。|#0201Adv14_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35,20 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:我之前好像有点误会希罗了呢。<br>你其实很体贴的。|#0201Adv14_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只是在说理所当然的事情。|#0201Adv14_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格小姐，请你还是躺下吧……<br>伤口可能会裂开的……|#0201Adv14_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真是的，梅露露。<br>你真爱担心呢♡|#0201Adv14_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Margo-Front,MainBackground-Front Lazy:false
@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground-Front Intensity:0 FadeDuration:0
