@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露轻轻扶着玛格的身体，<br>玛格就乖乖重新躺下了。|#0201Adv14_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:你已经吃过药了，<br>请先睡一觉吧。<br>现在还是需要静养的时期……|#0201Adv14_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

