@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:看着玛格闭眼入睡后，<br>我将视线转向梅露露。|#0201Adv14_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:你一直在照顾玛格吗。|#0201Adv14_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是的。因为是影响日常生活的重伤，<br>所以需要各种照料……|#0201Adv14_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，我绝对没有觉得麻烦……！<br>是我自愿的……！|#0201Adv14_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我仔细观察着强调这点的梅露露，<br>注意到她眼下似乎有了黑眼圈。|#0201Adv14_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:（……太爱操心也是个问题啊）|#0201Adv14_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:既然玛格睡着了，你也稍微休息一下吧。|#0201Adv14_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:好、好的。不过安安小姐也……|#0201Adv14_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安正睡在玛格旁边的床上。|#0201Adv14_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安为什么在这里？|#0201Adv14_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:好像是贫血了。<br>看她很难受，<br>所以就让她休息一下。|#0201Adv14_Meruru008| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:不知何时，<br>诺亚已经来到了安安的床边。|#0201Adv14_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

