[PrintTextModified Text:安安没事吧？|#0201Adv14_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『勿要管吾辈。勿要与吾辈说话』|#0201Adv14_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:喂喂，诺亚想在那个素描本上画画。|#0201Adv14_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『这是吾辈的东西。不允许擅自使用』|#0201Adv14_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是画画很好玩的哦？|#0201Adv14_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35,40 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:『吾辈不觉得有趣』|#0201Adv14_AnAn003| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:AnAn-Front,MainBackground-Front Lazy:false
