[PrintTextModified Text:我瞥了一眼诺亚缠着安安的样子，<br>转向了梅露露。|#0201Adv14_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:安安没什么问题吧？|#0201Adv14_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那个……她有点发烧，<br>可能是因为环境剧烈变化导致疲劳过度。|#0201Adv14_Meruru009| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然有点担心……但休息一下应该就会好起来的。|#0201Adv14_Meruru010| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊。那最好不要太吵闹。<br>玛格也睡着了，我们出去吧。|#0201Adv14_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:来，诺亚……|#0201Adv14_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
