[PrintTextModified Text:"『吾辈拥有轻度的【洗脑】魔法。<br>　只是对诺亚说，让她出去而已。<br>　只要不反复使用就不会对人体有影响』|#0201Adv14_AnAn004|" AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……挺有意思的。<br>能不能给我演示一下？|#0201Adv14_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安虽然脸色发白，但还是点了点头，<br>然后将视线转向诺亚。|#0201Adv14_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35,40 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:……吾辈口渴了。<br>诺亚，【用魔法给吾辈倒茶】。|#0201Adv14_AnAn005| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

