[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv14_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv14_AnAn006| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么了。这不是什么都没发生吗。|#0201Adv14_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奇、奇怪。不应该这样的。<br>诺亚，给吾辈倒茶——|#0201Adv14_AnAn007| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Noah Loop:false ScenePositionX:70|75|80 Duration:0.5|0.5|0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:那个，可能是你误会了诺亚的魔法？<br>诺亚的魔法呢，虽然是可以操控液体，<br>但只能【画画】哦。|#0201Adv14_Noah006| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚一边后退一边说道。|#0201Adv14_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然很想给你倒茶，<br>但好像做不到呢。诺亚必须得出去了，<br>拜拜～|#0201Adv14_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚一边挥手<br>一边离开了。|#0201Adv14_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:AnAn Category:Profile Version:5

